니다.​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aa748fce-2dc6-4cba-a187-04c3839e3a04\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-03befaff-327c-4231-970f-b01bb935de61\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-55da061a-a26a-4443-8079-ef4af6554065\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-aff76956-7ee0-4873-9036-ab18803f0c9f\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-21f9c45e-c55c-4315-8ac6-40ba23f37b10\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1a257063-4408-4761-9620-e2c20e43d8cd\"><b>📢 12월 7일(토) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-68eb66b4-a8ae-4533-aa06-1cc23ca6dd38\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f23f704d-d5e2-4477-85ef-09482a20ceec\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f3d713c2-5714-4ad8-92b1-e57879bc87e6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f4cad818-2078-47b3-8ace-33213035cc27\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-687e35c8-62f2-4c2c-a358-3ea059c5ce4b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d6a9ed74-64d9-423a-b0de-6fc2577365bb\">- 12/6(금) 22:00 ~ 12/7(토) 00:00경​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8bbf0556-16a1-4252-9017-dcd1fed9c083\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1d5c11b9-316e-49c3-ae8f-38e0b589bb28\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0d9db8ab-04bd-491e-a483-fe4ebae16070\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-848466c3-2372-4037-8214-9384c65301a4\">​</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0e1b19b1-08b0-4586-9400-02a67d6bf6b9\"><b>✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8caacf0c-3031-41d6-b4ba-a5fd3d0ab56c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-111417f0-0ec9-4daa-acef-93b3ba6ad0bb\">- 일부 언어의 로컬라이징 이슈를 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2e56572f-35eb-4169-ae1a-004e8df5b693\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a2e0e2a0-bf7e-4019-a5d7-ae898077c554\">- 메이든 : 아이스 로즈의 라이브 월페이퍼에서 일부 어색하게 보이는 부위를 조정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5182dd2d-17dd-4772-8c35-dfc73819dcf7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-da4a4600-6676-45b2-b14d-04c21145190a\">- 메이든 : 아이스 로즈의 스탠딩 모션에서 일부 어색하게 보이는 부위를 조정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e8590747-20b5-41c7-84a3-0489b1e7d5b7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3cc97b65-3fb2-4e12-97e2-dcc67206c6a9\">- 특정 상황에서 파견 게시판 진입 시 시스템 오류 메시지가 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0ed89c39-c2aa-496b-bfb3-f7c9669d1653\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1ec381ce-dd31-41f2-be11-7c0a1c2e8f0e\">- [중첩 가능 이로운 효과 중첩량 증가] 효과로 [경험치] 10중첩 시 길로틴 : 윈터 슬레이어의 [용사 레벨]이 상승하지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7d2698b1-8d4e-412b-8ad7-1ab4e84349fc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-18356f21-fb5c-413a-b8c7-df9e9eb06bad\">[대상]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fa79ce89-2202-485d-9c87-fc2b24c28339\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-07f52a77-cd93-49c5-9c4d-35a9e38a8189\">└ 페퍼 버스트 스킬 「페퍼 테라피」</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bbb8000a-51c5-4f86-ad49-482364bae362\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7704f824-9045-4171-8c2e-76cfd25b6940\">└ 미카 : 스노우 버디 스킬2 「응원의 축포」</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-23d0297a-30cd-4ef6-9fcd-f0cd1f07bdb1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f786b9b2-364b-4ad6-90e0-860b9b9bcf5a\">└ 앨리스 : 원더랜드 바니 스킬1 「당근과 토끼 파티」</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-917b132d-8531-4ffb-bdae-07eed469e719\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-11771398-d45d-475a-b4b2-9a7cfb7b595d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0f376872-d03d-4480-90c5-473d45e0566f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b35b36a1-4436-4bf6-b51d-81daacdced26\"><b>✔️ 파견 게시판 진입 불가 보상 안내</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5d2ba3a1-2b55-4cd2-90e4-054dff9f659f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-779c4ff1-5a1b-4461-94a2-58fba49b6529\">- 쥬얼 * 90</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1e47cc00-8148-4206-82eb-93cf659ae5df\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-96eda5a2-2717-4c0d-99e7-4cf2fc7c248a\">- 크레디트 케이스 (1H) * 12</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9cba02f7-32ec-4752-91f3-fe6a6f4d1531\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6b7e8bd1-0bf8-46ef-b279-103fbce2d3dc\">- 코어 더스트 케이스 (1H) * 12</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1b102df3-d64c-4f73-93f7-877eda9bf616\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7c14b95b-41c3-45ca-b621-f2d370cde371\">- 관리 키트 상자 Ⅱ * 8</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f6770b64-89ad-400b-9a83-7490e464ef8e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a6c2d6c6-03b9-4198-9c02-cec8cf396e7b\">- 잡동사니 박스 시즌 * 3</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-05fdbbfa-3058-4740-990c-22c1d308a1fe\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ad54d07c-cd41-400e-8d10-5a8b5616cde3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eb02977c-b899-4fc6-bfc3-a90db458a1bd\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7bbd08e4-e2c7-47e6-b0de-ca5a9f6f8c2f\">​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8e9dd747-8a6c-4d01-96c8-943eca993d1a\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-n